{
  "module_id": "insurance",
  "module_title": "Insurance Risk Shield",
  "slides": [
    {
      "slide_number": 1,
      "slide_id": "ins-s1",
      "description": "Insurance Slide 1 — screen_1_insurance_hook.html",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n@keyframes flicker1 { 0%, 100% { transform:scaleY(1) translateX(0); opacity:0.85;} 50% { transform:scaleY(1.15) translateX(1px); opacity:1;} }\n@keyframes flicker2 { 0%, 100% { transform:scaleY(1) translateX(0); opacity:0.7;} 50% { transform:scaleY(1.2) translateX(-1px); opacity:0.95;} }\n@keyframes flicker3 { 0%, 100% { transform:scaleY(1); opacity:0.9;} 50% { transform:scaleY(1.1); opacity:1;} }\n.seq1 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.1s both; }\n.seq2 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 1.3s both; }\n.f1 { animation: flicker1 1.1s ease-in-out 0.6s infinite; transform-origin: bottom center; }\n.f2 { animation: flicker2 0.9s ease-in-out 0.7s infinite; transform-origin: bottom center; }\n.f3 { animation: flicker3 1.3s ease-in-out 0.5s infinite; transform-origin: bottom center; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--surface-2, #FFFFFF); color: var(--text-primary, #171717); padding:22px; border-radius:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:22px; text-align:center;\">\n\n    <p class=\"seq1\" style=\"font-size:17px; font-weight:500; margin:0; max-width:230px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--text-primary);\">You're 22. You're healthy, you rent your apartment, and you feel invincible.</p>\n\n    <div style=\"position:relative; width:130px; height:110px; display:flex; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:center;\">\n      <div style=\"width:80px; height:60px; border-radius:4px; background:var(--surface-1); border:1.5px solid var(--border-strong); position:relative; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:flex-end; padding:6px; gap:3px;\">\n        <div style=\"height:3px; background:var(--border-strong); width:70%;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"height:3px; background:var(--border-strong); width:85%;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"height:3px; background:var(--border-strong); width:60%;\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <i class=\"ti ti-flame f1\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:0; left:22px; font-size:28px; color:var(--text-danger);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n      <i class=\"ti ti-flame f2\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:0; left:50px; font-size:34px; color:var(--text-danger);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n      <i class=\"ti ti-flame f3\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:0; right:18px; font-size:24px; color:var(--text-warning);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"seq2\" style=\"font-size:14px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:0; max-width:230px; line-height:1.6;\">To you, insurance feels like a scam — a boring monthly bill pushed by agents for a disaster that will probably never happen.</p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 2,
      "slide_id": "ins-s2",
      "description": "Insurance Slide 2 — screen_2_low_probability_high_cost.html",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n@keyframes lineGrow2 { 0% { width:0%;} 100% { width:100%;} }\n@keyframes splatIn { 0%, 55% { opacity:0; transform:scale(0.3);} 65% { opacity:1; transform:scale(1.2);} 75% { transform:scale(0.95);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:scale(1);} }\n.seq1 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.1s both; }\n.seq2 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 1.6s both; }\n.line-fill { animation: lineGrow2 1.2s cubic-bezier(.3,.6,.4,1) 0.4s both; }\n.splat { animation: splatIn 2.6s ease 0.4s infinite; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--surface-2, #FFFFFF); color: var(--text-primary, #171717); padding:22px; border-radius:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:20px; text-align:center;\">\n\n    <p class=\"seq1\" style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:500; margin:0; max-width:230px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--text-primary);\">You might have a 99%+ chance of being fine this year.</p>\n\n    <div style=\"position:relative; width:220px; height:40px; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\n      <div style=\"width:100%; height:3px; background:var(--surface-1); border-radius:2px; overflow:hidden;\">\n        <div class=\"line-fill\" style=\"height:100%; background:var(--border-strong);\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"splat\" style=\"position:absolute; left:76%; top:50%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%);\">\n        <svg width=\"46\" height=\"46\" viewBox=\"0 0 46 46\">\n          <circle cx=\"23\" cy=\"23\" r=\"10\" fill=\"var(--text-primary)\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"14\" r=\"4\" fill=\"var(--text-primary)\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\" fill=\"var(--text-primary)\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"30\" r=\"5\" fill=\"var(--text-primary)\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"32\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"var(--text-primary)\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"seq2\" style=\"font-size:14px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:0; max-width:230px; line-height:1.6;\">But that small remaining chance of a serious medical emergency doesn't just hurt — it can wipe out years of savings in one hospital bill.</p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 3,
      "slide_id": "ins-s3",
      "description": "Insurance Slide 3 — screen_3_the_risk_transfer.html",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n@keyframes weightMove { 0%, 20% { transform:translateX(0);} 55%, 100% { transform:translateX(64px);} }\n@keyframes vaultGlow { 0%, 45% { box-shadow:0 0 0 0 var(--bg-danger);} 60%, 100% { box-shadow:0 0 0 8px var(--bg-danger);} }\n.seq1 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.1s both; }\n.seq2 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 1.5s both; }\n.weight { animation: weightMove 2.6s ease-in-out 0.6s infinite; }\n.vault { animation: vaultGlow 2.6s ease-in-out 0.6s infinite; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--text-danger, #791F1F); color: var(--on-danger, #FFFFFF); padding:22px; border-radius:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:22px; text-align:center;\">\n\n    <p class=\"seq1\" style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:500; margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--text-primary);\">Insurance isn't really a product. It's Risk Transfer.</p>\n\n    <div style=\"position:relative; width:180px; height:90px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;\">\n      <i class=\"ti ti-user\" style=\"font-size:30px; color:var(--text-secondary);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n      <div class=\"weight\" style=\"position:absolute; left:34px; width:26px; height:26px; border-radius:5px; background:var(--text-danger); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n        <i class=\"ti ti-weight\" style=\"font-size:15px; color:var(--on-danger);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"vault\" style=\"width:56px; height:56px; border-radius:8px; background:var(--surface-1); border:1.5px solid var(--border-strong); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n        <i class=\"ti ti-building-bank\" style=\"font-size:26px; color:var(--text-secondary);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"seq2\" style=\"font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.6;\">You aren't buying a service — you're paying a financial institution a small, regular fee to take a catastrophic-cost scenario off your shoulders.</p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 4,
      "slide_id": "ins-s4",
      "description": "Insurance Slide 4 — screen_4_the_asymmetric_bet.html",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n@keyframes seesaw { 0%, 100% { transform:rotate(-3deg);} 50% { transform:rotate(3deg);} }\n.seq1 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.1s both; }\n.seq2 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 1.4s both; }\n.beam { animation: seesaw 3s ease-in-out 0.6s infinite; transform-origin: center; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--surface-2, #FFFFFF); color: var(--text-primary, #171717); padding:22px; border-radius:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:20px; text-align:center;\">\n\n    <p class=\"seq1\" style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:500; margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--text-primary);\">It's an asymmetric bet.</p>\n\n    <div style=\"position:relative; width:170px; height:100px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n      <div style=\"width:4px; height:36px; background:var(--border-strong);\"></div>\n      <svg class=\"beam\" width=\"160\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 160 14\">\n        <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"7\" stroke=\"var(--border-strong)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; top:36px; left:8px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:4px;\">\n        <div style=\"width:16px; height:16px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--text-accent); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n          <i class=\"ti ti-coin\" style=\"font-size:10px; color:var(--on-primary);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:9px; color:var(--text-muted);\">Your fee</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:6px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:4px;\">\n        <div style=\"width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:8px; background:var(--text-secondary); opacity:0.85;\"></div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:9px; color:var(--text-muted);\">The cost</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"seq2\" style=\"font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.6;\">The insurer contractually agrees to cover a much larger cost if the covered event happens — as long as your policy is active and the claim fits its terms.</p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 5,
      "slide_id": "ins-s5",
      "description": "Insurance Slide 5 — screen_5_read_the_fine_print.html",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n@keyframes lensHover { 0%, 100% { transform:translate(0,0);} 50% { transform:translate(6px,-4px);} }\n@keyframes clauseHighlight { 0%, 40% { background:transparent;} 55%, 100% { background:var(--bg-warning);} }\n.seq1 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.1s both; }\n.seq2 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 1.4s both; }\n.lens3 { animation: lensHover 2.6s ease-in-out 0.6s infinite; }\n.clause { animation: clauseHighlight 2.6s ease 0.6s infinite; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--surface-2, #FFFFFF); color: var(--text-primary, #171717); padding:22px; border-radius:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:18px; text-align:center;\">\n\n    <p class=\"seq1\" style=\"font-size:15.5px; font-weight:500; margin:0; max-width:230px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--text-primary);\">That last part matters: \"fits its terms.\"</p>\n\n    <div style=\"position:relative; width:150px; height:110px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n      <div style=\"width:110px; height:100px; border-radius:6px; background:var(--surface-1); border:1.5px solid var(--border-strong); padding:12px 10px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px; align-items:flex-start;\">\n        <div style=\"height:3px; width:80%; background:var(--border-strong);\"></div>\n        <div style=\"height:3px; width:65%; background:var(--border-strong);\"></div>\n        <span class=\"clause\" style=\"font-size:9px; color:var(--text-warning); padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px;\">2-4 yr waiting period</span>\n        <div style=\"height:3px; width:70%; background:var(--border-strong);\"></div>\n        <div style=\"height:3px; width:50%; background:var(--border-strong);\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <i class=\"ti ti-search lens3\" style=\"position:absolute; top:32px; right:8px; font-size:30px; color:var(--text-secondary);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"seq2\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.6;\">Every policy has exclusions and a waiting period — often 2–4 years — before certain pre-existing conditions are covered. Read what it actually promises before you rely on it.</p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 6,
      "slide_id": "ins-s6",
      "description": "Insurance Slide 6 — screen_6_protecting_the_firewall.html",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n@keyframes boltStrike { 0%, 30% { opacity:0; transform:translate(-30px,-20px) rotate(-15deg);} 45% { opacity:1; transform:translate(-4px,0) rotate(-15deg);} 55% { opacity:1; transform:translate(-4px,0) rotate(-15deg);} 100% { opacity:0; transform:translate(-4px,0) rotate(-15deg);} }\n@keyframes shieldFlash2 { 0%, 42% { filter:drop-shadow(0 0 0 transparent);} 50% { filter:drop-shadow(0 0 10px var(--text-accent));} 100% { filter:drop-shadow(0 0 0 transparent);} }\n.seq1 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.1s both; }\n.seq2 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 1.5s both; }\n.bolt { animation: boltStrike 2.6s ease 0.6s infinite; }\n.shield2 { animation: shieldFlash2 2.6s ease 0.6s infinite; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--surface-2, #FFFFFF); color: var(--text-primary, #171717); padding:22px; border-radius:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:20px; text-align:center;\">\n\n    <p class=\"seq1\" style=\"font-size:15.5px; font-weight:500; margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--text-primary);\">Remember your Tranche System? (Module 8.)</p>\n\n    <div style=\"position:relative; width:150px; height:100px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n      <svg width=\"90\" height=\"60\" viewBox=\"0 0 90 60\" style=\"position:absolute; right:0;\">\n        <polyline points=\"0,50 20,38 40,42 60,20 90,8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--text-success)\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <i class=\"ti ti-bolt bolt\" style=\"position:absolute; left:14px; font-size:26px; color:var(--text-danger);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n      <i class=\"ti ti-shield-check shield2\" style=\"position:absolute; left:38px; font-size:38px; color:var(--text-accent);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"seq2\" style=\"font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.6;\">Without health insurance, a single surgery can drain your Tranche 1 liquidity and force you to sell your Tranche 2 investments at the worst possible time. Insurance is the shield around that whole structure.</p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 7,
      "slide_id": "ins-s7",
      "description": "Insurance Slide 7 — screen_7_the_noise.html",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n@keyframes laserSweep { 0%, 25% { opacity:0; transform:translateX(-50px) rotate(20deg);} 45% { opacity:1; transform:translateX(0) rotate(20deg);} 65% { opacity:1; transform:translateX(50px) rotate(20deg);} 100% { opacity:0; transform:translateX(80px) rotate(20deg);} }\n@keyframes jargonFade { 0%, 45% { opacity:0.5;} 60%, 100% { opacity:0.12;} }\n@keyframes shieldsReveal { 0%, 55% { opacity:0; transform:scale(0.6);} 75% { opacity:1; transform:scale(1.1);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:scale(1);} }\n.seq1 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.1s both; }\n.seq2 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 1.8s both; }\n.laser { animation: laserSweep 2.8s ease 0.5s infinite; }\n.jargon { animation: jargonFade 2.8s ease 0.5s infinite; }\n.shield-a { animation: shieldsReveal 2.8s ease 0.5s infinite; }\n.shield-b { animation: shieldsReveal 2.8s ease 0.6s infinite; }\n.shield-c { animation: shieldsReveal 2.8s ease 0.7s infinite; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--surface-2, #FFFFFF); color: var(--text-primary, #171717); padding:22px; border-radius:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:18px; text-align:center;\">\n\n    <p class=\"seq1\" style=\"font-size:15px; font-weight:500; margin:0; max-width:230px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--text-primary);\">The insurance industry sells a lot of complexity.</p>\n\n    <div style=\"position:relative; width:180px; height:110px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n      <div class=\"jargon\" style=\"position:absolute; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; justify-content:center; max-width:170px;\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:9px; color:var(--text-muted); padding:3px 6px; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:6px;\">ULIP</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:9px; color:var(--text-muted); padding:3px 6px; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:6px;\">Endowment</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:9px; color:var(--text-muted); padding:3px 6px; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:6px;\">Whole-life</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:9px; color:var(--text-muted); padding:3px 6px; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:6px;\">Rider bundle</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:9px; color:var(--text-muted); padding:3px 6px; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:6px;\">Money-back</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"laser\" style=\"position:absolute; width:180px; height:3px; background:var(--text-accent);\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; display:flex; gap:10px;\">\n        <i class=\"shield-a ti ti-heartbeat\" style=\"font-size:22px; color:var(--text-accent);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n        <i class=\"shield-b ti ti-ghost\" style=\"font-size:22px; color:var(--text-accent);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n        <i class=\"shield-c ti ti-car\" style=\"font-size:22px; color:var(--text-accent);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"seq2\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.6;\">Many of these bundle insurance and investing together, and usually do both worse than buying them separately. In your 20s, there are three shields worth understanding first.</p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 8,
      "slide_id": "ins-s8",
      "description": "Insurance Slide 8 — screen_8_shield_1_the_body.html",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n@keyframes auraPulse { 0%, 100% { opacity:0.3; transform:scale(1);} 50% { opacity:0.6; transform:scale(1.08);} }\n.seq1 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.1s both; }\n.seq2 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 1.5s both; }\n.aura { animation: auraPulse 2.4s ease-in-out 0.6s infinite; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--surface-2, #FFFFFF); color: var(--text-primary, #171717); padding:22px; border-radius:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center;\">\n\n    <span style=\"font-size:11px; font-weight:600; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:8px; background:var(--bg-accent); color:var(--text-accent);\">SHIELD 1 &middot; THE BODY</span>\n\n    <div style=\"position:relative; width:100px; height:110px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n      <div class=\"aura\" style=\"position:absolute; width:90px; height:90px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--bg-accent);\"></div>\n      <i class=\"ti ti-heartbeat\" style=\"position:relative; font-size:44px; color:var(--text-accent);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"seq1\" style=\"font-size:15px; font-weight:500; margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--text-primary);\">Your greatest wealth-building asset right now is your ability to work.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"seq2\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.6;\">Health insurance ensures a medical problem doesn't also become a financial one. Your employer's policy helps while you're there — but it usually ends the day you quit or get laid off, right when you might need it most.</p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 9,
      "slide_id": "ins-s9",
      "description": "Insurance Slide 9 — screen_9_shield_2_the_ghost.html",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n@keyframes pinGlow { 0%, 100% { box-shadow:0 0 0 0 var(--bg-accent);} 50% { box-shadow:0 0 0 6px var(--bg-accent);} }\n.seq1 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.1s both; }\n.seq2 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 1.6s both; }\n.pin-glow { animation: pinGlow 2.2s ease-in-out 0.6s infinite; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--text-danger, #791F1F); color: var(--on-danger, #FFFFFF); padding:22px; border-radius:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center;\">\n\n    <span style=\"font-size:11px; font-weight:600; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:8px; background:var(--bg-accent); color:var(--text-accent);\">SHIELD 2 &middot; THE GHOST</span>\n\n    <p class=\"seq1\" style=\"font-size:14.5px; font-weight:500; margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--text-primary);\">This is pure math. You lock in your rate — not your coverage forever.</p>\n\n    <div style=\"width:220px; padding:6px 0;\">\n      <div style=\"position:relative; height:4px; background:var(--surface-1); border-radius:2px;\">\n        <div class=\"pin-glow\" style=\"position:absolute; left:14%; top:50%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%); width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--text-accent);\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute; left:80%; top:50%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%); width:2px; height:14px; background:var(--text-danger);\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:9.5px; color:var(--text-muted); margin-top:8px;\">\n        <span>Age 23</span>\n        <span>Age 53</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:2px;\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:10px; color:var(--text-accent); font-weight:500;\">Rate locked</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:10px; color:var(--text-danger); font-weight:500;\">Term ends</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"seq2\" style=\"font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.6;\">Lock in a policy at 23, and your rate stays fixed for the term you choose — far cheaper than starting the same term later. Choose a term that runs through your working years.</p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 10,
      "slide_id": "ins-s10",
      "description": "Insurance Slide 10 — screen_10_shield_3_the_baseline.html",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n@keyframes checkIn { 0% { opacity:0; transform:scale(0.5);} 60% { transform:scale(1.15);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:scale(1);} }\n@keyframes xIn { 0% { opacity:0; transform:scale(0.5) rotate(-20deg);} 60% { transform:scale(1.15) rotate(0deg);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:scale(1) rotate(0deg);} }\n.seq1 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.1s both; }\n.seq2 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 1.4s both; }\n.badge-check { animation: checkIn 0.4s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) 0.6s both; }\n.badge-x { animation: xIn 0.4s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) 0.9s both; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--text-danger, #791F1F); color: var(--on-danger, #FFFFFF); padding:22px; border-radius:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:18px; text-align:center;\">\n\n    <span style=\"font-size:11px; font-weight:600; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:8px; background:var(--bg-accent); color:var(--text-accent);\">SHIELD 3 &middot; THE BASELINE</span>\n\n    <p class=\"seq1\" style=\"font-size:15px; font-weight:500; margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--text-primary);\">Don't insure cheap things.</p>\n\n    <div style=\"display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start;\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:6px;\">\n        <div style=\"position:relative; width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:10px; background:var(--bg-success); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n          <i class=\"ti ti-car\" style=\"font-size:24px; color:var(--text-success);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n          <div class=\"badge-check\" style=\"position:absolute; top:-6px; right:-6px; width:18px; height:18px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--text-success); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n            <i class=\"ti ti-check\" style=\"font-size:11px; color:var(--on-success);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:10px; color:var(--text-muted);\">Car</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:6px;\">\n        <div style=\"position:relative; width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:10px; background:var(--bg-success); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n          <i class=\"ti ti-device-laptop\" style=\"font-size:24px; color:var(--text-success);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n          <div class=\"badge-check\" style=\"position:absolute; top:-6px; right:-6px; width:18px; height:18px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--text-success); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n            <i class=\"ti ti-check\" style=\"font-size:11px; color:var(--on-success);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:10px; color:var(--text-muted);\">Home contents</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:6px;\">\n        <div style=\"position:relative; width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:10px; background:var(--bg-danger); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n          <i class=\"ti ti-headphones\" style=\"font-size:24px; color:var(--text-danger);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n          <div class=\"badge-x\" style=\"position:absolute; top:-6px; right:-6px; width:18px; height:18px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--text-danger); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n            <i class=\"ti ti-x\" style=\"font-size:11px; color:var(--on-danger);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:10px; color:var(--text-muted);\">Headphones</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"seq2\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.6;\">Insure what would actually hurt to replace tomorrow — your car, or your apartment's contents in a fire or theft.</p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 11,
      "slide_id": "ins-s11",
      "description": "Insurance Slide 11 — screen_11_the_pivot_risk_audit.html",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n.seq1 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.1s both; }\n.seq2 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.35s both; }\n.seq3 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.65s both; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--text-danger, #791F1F); color: var(--on-danger, #FFFFFF); padding:22px; border-radius:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center;\">\n\n    <p class=\"seq1\" style=\"font-size:20px; font-weight:500; line-height:1.4; margin:0; color:var(--on-danger); max-width:210px;\">Stop reading. Let's audit your shields.</p>\n    <p class=\"seq2\" style=\"font-size:14px; color:var(--on-danger); opacity:0.85; margin:0; max-width:205px; line-height:1.55;\">Are you exposed to a costly gap right now? Let's find out.</p>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <button class=\"seq3\" style=\"width:100%; height:46px; border-radius:var(--radius); background:var(--on-danger); color:var(--text-danger); border:none; font-size:14px; font-weight:600;\">Run my Risk Audit</button>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 12,
      "slide_id": "ins-s12",
      "description": "Insurance Slide 12 — screen_12_corporate_leash.html",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n.i-1 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.1s both; }\n.i-2 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.35s both; }\n.i-3 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.6s both; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--fill-primary, #171717); color: #FFFFFF; padding:22px; border-radius:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; gap:18px;\">\n\n    <i class=\"ti ti-heartbeat\" style=\"font-size:26px; color:var(--text-accent);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n\n    <p class=\"i-1\" style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:500; margin:0; line-height:1.5;\">Do you have a personal health insurance policy that's completely separate from your employer?</p>\n\n    <div class=\"i-2\" style=\"display:flex; gap:10px;\">\n      <button style=\"flex:1; height:50px; border-radius:12px; border:1.5px solid var(--border-accent); background:var(--bg-accent); color:var(--text-accent); font-size:14px; font-weight:500;\">Yes</button>\n      <button style=\"flex:1; height:50px; border-radius:12px; border:1.5px solid var(--border); background:var(--surface-1); color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:14px; font-weight:500;\">No</button>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <button class=\"i-3\" style=\"width:100%; height:46px; border-radius:var(--radius); background:var(--fill-primary); color:var(--on-primary); border:none; font-size:14px; font-weight:500;\">Next</button>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 13,
      "slide_id": "ins-s13",
      "description": "Insurance Slide 13 — screen_13_the_early_lock.html",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n.i-1 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.1s both; }\n.i-2 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.35s both; }\n.i-3 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.6s both; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--fill-primary, #171717); color: #FFFFFF; padding:22px; border-radius:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; gap:18px;\">\n\n    <i class=\"ti ti-ghost\" style=\"font-size:26px; color:var(--text-accent);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n\n    <p class=\"i-1\" style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:500; margin:0; line-height:1.5;\">Have you locked in a base Term Life policy while your premiums are still at their cheapest for your age?</p>\n\n    <div class=\"i-2\" style=\"display:flex; gap:10px;\">\n      <button style=\"flex:1; height:50px; border-radius:12px; border:1.5px solid var(--border-accent); background:var(--bg-accent); color:var(--text-accent); font-size:14px; font-weight:500;\">Yes</button>\n      <button style=\"flex:1; height:50px; border-radius:12px; border:1.5px solid var(--border); background:var(--surface-1); color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:14px; font-weight:500;\">No</button>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <button class=\"i-3\" style=\"width:100%; height:46px; border-radius:var(--radius); background:var(--fill-primary); color:var(--on-primary); border:none; font-size:14px; font-weight:500;\">Analyze my exposure</button>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 14,
      "slide_id": "ins-s14",
      "description": "Insurance Slide 14 — screen_14_output_tranches_exposed.html",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n@keyframes alertFlash { 0%, 100% { opacity:0.5;} 50% { opacity:1;} }\n@keyframes crackPulse { 0%, 100% { opacity:0.7;} 50% { opacity:1;} }\n.seq1 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.1s both; }\n.seq2 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 1.2s both; }\n.alert-badge { animation: alertFlash 1.4s ease-in-out 0.4s infinite; }\n.crack { animation: crackPulse 1.4s ease-in-out 0.4s infinite; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--surface-2, #FFFFFF); color: var(--text-primary, #171717); padding:22px; border-radius:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center;\">\n\n    <div class=\"alert-badge\" style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:var(--bg-danger); border-radius:8px; padding:6px 12px;\">\n      <i class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle\" style=\"font-size:15px; color:var(--text-danger);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n      <span style=\"font-size:11.5px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-danger);\">SYSTEM ALERT</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"seq1\" style=\"font-size:17px; font-weight:500; margin:0; max-width:220px; line-height:1.4; color:var(--text-primary);\">Your Tranches Are Exposed</p>\n\n    <div style=\"position:relative; width:100px; height:100px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n      <i class=\"ti ti-shield-check\" style=\"font-size:64px; color:var(--border-strong);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n      <svg class=\"crack\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" style=\"position:absolute;\">\n        <path d=\"M32 8 L26 26 L36 30 L24 56\" stroke=\"var(--text-danger)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"seq2\" style=\"font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.6;\">Right now, a job loss and a medical emergency happening close together could seriously damage your finances — with no policy in place to absorb the hit.</p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 15,
      "slide_id": "ins-s15",
      "description": "Insurance Slide 15 — screen_15_the_fix.html",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n@keyframes wrenchTurn { 0%, 100% { transform:rotate(-18deg);} 50% { transform:rotate(8deg);} }\n.seq1 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.1s both; }\n.seq2 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 1.4s both; }\n.wrench { animation: wrenchTurn 1.6s ease-in-out 0.6s infinite; transform-origin: 70% 70%; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--surface-2, #FFFFFF); color: var(--text-primary, #171717); padding:22px; border-radius:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:20px; text-align:center;\">\n\n    <p class=\"seq1\" style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:500; margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--text-primary);\">Fixing this doesn't take long.</p>\n\n    <div style=\"position:relative; width:100px; height:90px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n      <div style=\"width:70px; height:50px; border-radius:6px; background:var(--surface-1); border:1.5px solid var(--border-strong);\"></div>\n      <i class=\"ti ti-tools wrench\" style=\"position:absolute; font-size:34px; color:var(--text-accent);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"seq2\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.6;\">A basic term and health policy at your age is often surprisingly affordable — though the exact cost depends on your age, health, and cover amount. You don't need a premium agent, just a basic, direct-to-consumer policy to plug the gap.</p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 16,
      "slide_id": "ins-s16",
      "description": "Insurance Slide 16 — screen_16_final_action.html",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n@keyframes shieldSettle { 0%, 100% { transform:translateY(0);} 50% { transform:translateY(-3px);} }\n.seq1 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.1s both; }\n.seq2 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.35s both; }\n.seq3 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.6s both; }\n.seq4 { animation: drift 0.5s ease 0.8s both; }\n.shield-final { animation: shieldSettle 2.4s ease-in-out 0.6s infinite; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--fill-primary, #171717); color: #FFFFFF; padding:22px; border-radius:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:18px; text-align:center;\">\n\n    <i class=\"ti ti-shield-check shield-final\" style=\"font-size:44px; color:var(--text-accent);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n\n    <p class=\"seq1\" style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:500; margin:0; max-width:225px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--text-primary);\">You can't confidently play offense if your defense has an open gap.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"seq2\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:0; max-width:220px; line-height:1.6;\">Look up a direct base health and term policy today — read the exclusions and waiting period before you buy. Protect the engine.</p>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px;\">\n    <button class=\"seq3\" style=\"width:100%; height:48px; border-radius:var(--radius); background:var(--fill-primary); color:var(--on-primary); border:none; font-size:14px; font-weight:500;\">Learn how to pick a Health Policy</button>\n    <button class=\"seq4\" style=\"width:100%; height:36px; border-radius:var(--radius); background:transparent; color:var(--text-muted); border:none; font-size:13px;\">Not right now</button>\n  </div>\n</div>"
    }
  ]
}